{"id": "t084-001", "text": "Ebony has a second interview at the architecture firm next Tuesday. She sounded really nervous about the presentation part. She's spent the whole weekend rebuilding her portfolio and says she still isn't happy with it. Her partner is taking her out for breakfast beforehand to calm her down. Remind me to text her good luck on Monday night.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ebony", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second interview at the architecture firm", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the whole weekend"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't happy with it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "beforehand"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
