{"id": "t084-007", "text": "Zofia and her husband are doing the Edinburgh Fringe over the summer with their improv group. She said it's a ten-night run at a tiny venue near the Meadows, and they've already sold half the tickets. Her daughter is coming up to help with the lighting.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Edinburgh Fringe", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "improv", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}]}
