{"id": "t084-010", "text": "Aisha got the graduate scheme at Rolls-Royce! Starts in September. Must send her a card this weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduate scheme at Rolls-Royce", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Starts", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her a card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t084-011", "text": "Wei's recital is tomorrow evening. Her teacher said she's ready, but she's been practising until midnight all week and barely eating. Her mum is flying in from Shanghai for it, which is adding to the pressure. Don't forget to message her after to see how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recital", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow evening", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "teacher", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until midnight all week"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Shanghai", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "a1"}]}
