{"id": "t084-013", "text": "Javier mentioned his sister Mabel is applying for nursing jobs in Leeds. She has an assessment day next Wednesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Javier", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mabel", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "applying for nursing jobs in Leeds", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "assessment day", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Wednesday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t084-014", "text": "Emily's dog Biscuit had his leg operation yesterday. He's home and sulking in a cone. She's taking Friday off to keep an eye on him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leg operation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday"}]}
{"id": "t084-015", "text": "Running the Parkrun on Saturday, then the 10k in early April. Need new trainers before then.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Parkrun", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "10k", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early April", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "new trainers", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before then", "anchor": "a1"}]}
