{"id": "t084-017", "text": "Remind me to ring Jada on Sunday. Her dad is in hospital again and she's been driving up and down the M6 every other day.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring Jada", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every other day"}]}
{"id": "t084-018", "text": "Jess loves anything to do with Formula One. Her birthday is in a fortnight, so tickets to the Silverstone museum would go down well.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jess", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Formula One", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "tickets to the Silverstone museum would go down well", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t084-019", "text": "Esme's play opened last night and apparently it was a disaster: the set collapsed in the second act. Should check how the rest of the run is going later in the week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esme", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "play", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check how the rest of the run is going", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "later in the week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t084-020", "text": "Mia has applied for a head of department role at her school. Interviews are sometime next week, but she hasn't heard which day yet. She's up against a colleague she gets on well with, which makes it awkward in the staffroom. She's asked me to do a mock interview with her on Sunday afternoon, so I should dig out some typical questions.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Interviews", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "colleague", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "mock interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday afternoon", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "dig out some typical questions", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t084-021", "text": "Isabel and Rohan are doing the Three Peaks challenge over the summer for a charity their mum supports. I said I'd sponsor them.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isabel", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Three Peaks challenge", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}]}
