{"id": "t084-023", "text": "Had lunch with Hemi. He's left the agency and is freelancing now, mostly brand work. He's also learning Portuguese because his partner's family are in Lisbon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hemi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "freelancing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "mostly brand work", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Portuguese", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Lisbon", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "home"}]}
{"id": "t084-024", "text": "Sinead's choir concert on Friday has been cancelled because the church roof is leaking. They're hoping to rearrange for early December.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sinead", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "choir", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "rearrange", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "early December", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t084-025", "text": "Niamh said she's thinking of applying for the PhD in Galway. Deadline is the end of January.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Niamh", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "applying for the PhD in Galway", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of January", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t084-026", "text": "Jun has his citizenship interview next Monday. He's been revising the history booklet every night. I should text him the morning of to wish him luck.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jun", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "citizenship interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every night"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the morning of", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t084-027", "text": "Eva was telling me about her brother Jack's band. They've got a support slot at the Roundhouse next Thursday, which is huge for them. She's going with her parents and a load of cousins, and they've all made T-shirts. Jack apparently hasn't slept properly in days because the setlist keeps changing. Remind me to ask her how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "support slot at the Roundhouse", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in days"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t084-028", "text": "Rachel works nights at the hospital, so don't call before two.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rachel", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "works nights at the hospital", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before two"}]}
{"id": "t084-029", "text": "Shira and her wife are moving to Bristol at the end of the month. Their new place has a garden for the cats, Pickle and Fig.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shira", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Bristol", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "has a garden", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cats, Pickle and Fig", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
