{"id": "t084-032", "text": "Gustavo's wife Agnieszka is pregnant! Due early May. They told us at dinner.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gustavo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Agnieszka", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early May", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t084-033", "text": "Spoke to Anders Olsen at the conference. He runs recruitment for a fintech in Oslo and said to send him my CV sometime next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders Olsen", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "runs recruitment for a fintech in Oslo", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him my CV", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t084-034", "text": "Jada's interview at the BBC went well. They said she'd hear back by Friday. Remind me to text her on Saturday if she hasn't said anything. If she gets it, she'd be moving to Salford sometime in the new year, which she's quite excited about. Her flatmate Esme is already looking at rooms up there too.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview at the BBC", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Friday"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Salford", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the new year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite excited", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "flatmate", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esme", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t084-035", "text": "Ebony mentioned that her mum is having a hip replacement in early February. Ebony will stay with her for a fortnight afterwards.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ebony", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip replacement", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early February", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ebony", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stay with her", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a fortnight afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t084-036", "text": "Moira is a huge rugby fan and never misses a Scotland match. She has a season ticket at Murrayfield.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Moira", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "rugby", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "never misses a Scotland match", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "season ticket at Murrayfield", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t084-037", "text": "Phoned Wei after the recital. She played beautifully and the examiner gave her a distinction. She's thrilled.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recital", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t084-038", "text": "Spending the weekend clearing out the loft. Tip run on Sunday morning.", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Tip run", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday morning", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t084-039", "text": "Mia got the head of department job! She starts after Easter. Should get her a nice bottle of something to celebrate.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "head of department job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after Easter", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get her a nice bottle of something", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t084-040", "text": "Javier is coaching his daughter's under-tens team. They've got the county cup semi-final next Saturday and he's already lost his voice from shouting at training.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Javier", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "coaching", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "county cup semi-final", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t084-041", "text": "Ibrahim said his wedding in June is off. He and Zofia split up last month. Apparently they're still sharing the flat until the end of the month while she looks for somewhere. He seemed okay but quiet. I must check in with him next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ibrahim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in June"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the end of the month"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "okay", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "quiet", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t084-042", "text": "Kaito passed his piano exam with merit. Svetlana sent a video of him playing at the café afterwards.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kaito", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "piano exam", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Svetlana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards"}]}
{"id": "t084-043", "text": "Aisha's brother Rohan has a trial with Exeter City this weekend. She thinks he's got a real chance but he's terrified.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "trial with Exeter City", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t084-044", "text": "Esme said she has an audition for the Old Vic youth company sometime next week. She's been practising her monologue on her cat, Mabel, who walks out halfway through every time.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esme", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "audition for the Old Vic youth company", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat, Mabel", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
{"id": "t084-045", "text": "Need to finish the cover letter for the Deloitte role by Thursday and ask Emily to read it over.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "finish the cover letter for the Deloitte role", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Thursday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Emily to read it over", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t084-046", "text": "Hemi's daughter is starting university in Dunedin early next year. He and his partner are flying out with her and staying for a fortnight.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hemi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "university in Dunedin", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early next year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a fortnight", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t084-047", "text": "Niamh doesn't like big surprise parties, so keep her fortieth low key. Her husband said a quiet dinner would be best.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Niamh", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't like big surprise parties", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fortieth", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "quiet dinner would be best", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t084-048", "text": "Isabel Reyes from the interview panel said they'd make a decision by the end of the week. She also mentioned they're hiring a second analyst over the summer.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isabel Reyes", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "interview panel", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "decision", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the end of the week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer"}]}
{"id": "t084-049", "text": "Sunil and Rachel's anniversary is on Saturday. Twenty years! They're going to Paris for the long weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sunil", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rachel", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Twenty years", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going to Paris", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the long weekend", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t084-050", "text": "Went to see Jack's band last night. Loud, sweaty and brilliant. Ask him for the setlist so I can find the songs.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him for the setlist", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t084-051", "text": "Jess has had a rough week. She was made redundant on Monday and has a meeting with HR on Friday about the package. Remind me to call her on Friday evening to see how she's doing. She also mentioned she might retrain as a teacher, which she's wanted to do for years.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jess", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "meeting with HR", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday evening", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "might retrain as a teacher", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "years"}]}
{"id": "t084-052", "text": "Mrs Thomas next door is entering her marrows in the village show this weekend. She won second place last year and has been out in the garden at dawn every day.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Thomas", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "next door", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "marrows", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "village show", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last year"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "dawn every day"}]}
{"id": "t084-053", "text": "Remember the MOT on Tuesday, drop the car off by eight. Pick up a prescription on the way back.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "MOT", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop the car off", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by eight", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Pick up a prescription", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the way back", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t084-054", "text": "Uncle Gustavo is doing a charity swim across Lake Windermere next month. He's seventy-one and has been training at the lido every morning. The family are all going to Bowness to cheer him on, and Aunt Moira is organising a picnic for afterwards. Should sponsor him before the deadline.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle Gustavo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "charity swim across Lake Windermere", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "seventy-one", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every morning"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aunt Moira", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "picnic", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sponsor him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the deadline", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t084-055", "text": "Shira told me her son has his driving test on Monday. Fourth attempt. She's not saying a word to anyone so he doesn't feel the pressure.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shira", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t084-056", "text": "Salma's job interview was moved from Wednesday to next Friday. She was relieved because it gives her more time to prepare the case study. The panel is four people, including the regional director, so she's nervous. Her brother Ibrahim is lending her his good suit. I'll ask her how it went over the weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Salma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from Wednesday"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "to next Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ibrahim", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the weekend"}]}
{"id": "t084-057", "text": "Zofia has started running again after her knee surgery. She's aiming for the Great North Run in September.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "running", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee surgery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Great North Run", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t084-058", "text": "Thinking about applying for the project manager role that came up internally. Applications close sometime next week, so I need to update my CV over the weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "applying for the project manager role", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "update my CV", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t084-059", "text": "Rohan said Hemi wants a new pair of noise-cancelling headphones for Christmas. He's been dropping hints for weeks.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hemi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants a new pair of noise-cancelling headphones", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "weeks"}]}
{"id": "t084-060", "text": "Quick note: the Jun Nakamura recital is on the fifteenth, not the fourteenth. Tickets are in my email.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jun Nakamura", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recital", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the fifteenth", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the fourteenth"}]}
